#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "timeout - run a command with a time limit"
msgstr "timeout — kör ett kommando med en tidsgräns"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<timeout> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>] I<\\,DURATION COMMAND \\/>[I<\\,ARG\\/>]..."
msgstr ""
"B<timeout> [I<\\,FLAGGA\\/>] I<\\,LÖPTID KOMMANDO \\/>[I<\\,ARG\\/>]..."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<timeout> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]"
msgstr "B<timeout> [I<\\,FLAGGA\\/>]"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "BESKRIVNING"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Start COMMAND, and kill it if still running after DURATION."
msgstr "Starta KOMMANDO, och döda det om det fortfarande kör efter LÖPTID."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr ""
"Obligatoriska argument till långa flaggor är obligatoriska även för de korta."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<--preserve-status>"
msgstr "B<--preserve-status>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "exit with the same status as COMMAND, even when the"
msgstr "Avsluta med samma status som KOMMANDO, även när tiden för"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "command times out"
msgstr "kommandot löper ut."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<--foreground>"
msgstr "B<--foreground>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "when not running timeout directly from a shell prompt,"
msgstr "När timeout inte körs direkt från en skalprompt,"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"allow COMMAND to read from the TTY and get TTY signals; in this mode, "
"children of COMMAND will not be timed out"
msgstr ""
"låt KOMMANDO läsa från TTY:n och ta emot TTY-signaler; i detta läge kommer "
"tiden för barn till KOMMANDO inte gå ut."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<-k>, B<--kill-after>=I<\\,DURATION\\/>"
msgstr "B<-k>, B<--kill-after>=I<\\,LÖPTID\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "also send a KILL signal if COMMAND is still running"
msgstr "Skicka även en KILL-signal om KOMMANDO fortfarande kör så"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "this long after the initial signal was sent"
msgstr "här länge efter att den ursprungliga signalen skickades."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<-s>, B<--signal>=I<\\,SIGNAL\\/>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--signal>=I<\\,SIGNAL\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "specify the signal to be sent on timeout;"
msgstr "Ange signalen som skall skickas när tiden går ut;"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"SIGNAL may be a name like 'HUP' or a number; see 'kill B<-l>' for a list of "
"signals"
msgstr ""
"SIGNAL kan vara ett namn som ”HUP” eller ett nummer; se B<kill -l> för en "
"lista över signaler."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-v>, B<--verbose>"
msgstr "B<-v>, B<--verbose>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "diagnose to stderr any signal sent upon timeout"
msgstr "Diagnostisera till standard fel signaler som skickas när tiden går ut."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "visa denna hjälp och avsluta"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "visa versionsinformation och avsluta"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"DURATION is a floating point number with an optional suffix: \\&'s' for "
"seconds (the default), 'm' for minutes, 'h' for hours or 'd' for days.  A "
"duration of 0 disables the associated timeout."
msgstr ""
"LÖPTID är ett flyttal eventuellt följt av ett suffix: ”s” för sekunder "
"(standard), ”m” för minuter, ”h” för timmar eller ”d” för dagar. En löptid "
"på 0 avaktiverar den tillhörande tidsgränsen."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Upon timeout, send the TERM signal to COMMAND, if no other SIGNAL "
"specified.  The TERM signal kills any process that does not block or catch "
"that signal.  It may be necessary to use the KILL signal, since this signal "
"can't be caught."
msgstr ""
"När tiden går ut, skicka signalen TERM  till KOMMANDO, om ingen annan signal "
"anges. Signalen TERM dödar en process som inte blockerar eller fångar den "
"signalen.  Det kan vara nödvändigt att använda signalen KILL, eftersom den "
"signalen inte kan fångas."

